  "description": "La Vida means street life and that's exactly what this bike is, built for the streets. Full Cr-Mo frame fork, bar and cranks. Sealed bike throughout with 28/9 gearing. Finished with double wall rims and Chad Kerley's signature tires. There's nothing this bike won't handle.\n100% Cr-Mo frame with integrated head tube, Mid BB shell, integrated seat clamp and removable brake and cable mounts 21\" top tube\n100% Cr-Mo fork with internal threaded steer tube and tapered legs\n100% Cr-Mo 9.25\" bars with Premium top load stem.\nPremium flangeless Team Grips.\nThree-piece Cr-Mo 175mm 8-spline cranks with sealed Mid BB.\n28/9 gearing with alloy sprocket.\nFully sealed wheels with front and rear double-wall rims and free-coaster rear hub.\nPremium CK tires 2.4\" front and rear.\nPremium Fat Capitol Pivotal seat with alloy Pivotal post.\nPremium Kinetic plastic pedals.",
